      "category": "Text",
      "text": "PROVIDING FOR PAYMENT FOR THE USE AND SUPPLY\nOF WATER BY HOSPITALS, ORPHAN ASYLUMS AND\nOTHER CHARITABLE INSTITUTIONS WHICH ARE\nELIGIBLE TO RECEIVE REIMBURSEMENT FROM EITHER\nTHE UNITED STATES, THE STATE OF NEW YORK OR\nTHE CITY OF NEW YORK, OR ANY AGENCY THEREOF.",
