    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        119,
        785,
        961,
        850
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, water charges are clearly not a tax but a bill\nfor the purchase of a product, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
